  "label": "User projected onto the dehumanizing metaphor scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where the human skeleton is used as a visual metaphor for dehumanization, implying that Black people are inherently primitive or animal-like. This projection is implicit, as the user is not directly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the entire meme is constructed to make the viewer internalize the racist message by associating the visual of the skeleton with the targeted group. The user is thus projected onto the scene of racialized dehumanization.",
